Quest: Quest
Event: Event
AtQuests: at {0} quests
AtQuestsBody: The Angler gives it for the quest that brings your count to {0}
IfYouHaveNone: if you have none
IfYouHaveNoneBody: Only to a player with none in the inventory, equipment or banks; anyone else gets the usual reward
AfterQuests: after {0} quests
ChanceBody: "{0} on the first quest that can give it, about {1} after 150 quests; a happy Angler gives better odds"
OneOfTackle: one of {0} fishing accessories
TackleBody: When no rarer reward comes, one of the fishing accessories you have none of (any of them once you have all). With none of them yet, each: {0} on the first quest, about {1} after 150 quests
IfNothingElse: if nothing else comes
PotionBody: When no other reward comes, one of the fishing potions: {0} on the first quest, about {1} after 150 quests
HoneyBody: On a quest for it without a fixed reward: {0} before hardmode, {1} in hardmode
OneOfDecorations: one of {0} decorations
DecorationBody: On top of the main reward: {0} on the first quest, rising to {1} at 100 quests
BaitOnTop: bait on top
BaitBody: Often given on top of the main reward: {0} on the first quest, about {1} after 150 quests
WhileEquipped: grows while equipped
BeardBody: Equipped in an accessory slot, it grows into the next beard after a little more than 12 minutes
InAnExtractinator: in an Extractinator
ExtractinatorBody: Fed to an Extractinator or a Chlorophyte Extractinator
WithAnotherGlowingMoss: with another glowing moss
GlowingMossBody: Fed one of these, it gives a glowing moss one time in ten: {0}
TorchGod: Torch God
TorchGodLabel: over 100 torches underground
TorchGodBody: With more than 100 torches near you below the surface, the Torch God turns them against you; survive 95 of his attacks and he leaves his favor. He does not come while you carry it or once you have used one
DroppedByItsEnemies: dropped by its enemies
OldOnesArmyBody: Its enemies drop this during the event, up to a set amount in each wave
DuringAParty: during a party
PartyBody: Once per party (five or more town NPCs must be home), the first player to talk to her gets a slice
NewCharacter: New character
CollectorsEdition: Collector's Edition
CollectorsEditionBody: A character created on a PC where the Collector's Edition of Terraria is installed starts with it
MoreThan50StartingItems: more than 50 starting items
StartingBagBody: tModLoader puts the starting items that do not fit in a new character's inventory into this bag
TurnsToStoneByDay: turns to stone by day
GnomeBody: By day, where the wind reaches, a Gnome turns into a Garden Gnome statue; break it to take it
EyeAndWall: "{0} and {1}"
OnTheSameDay: on the same day
SameDayBody: Defeat both on the same day: the second of them drops it
NextToTombstones: Next to tombstones
TombstoneBody: Grows now and then on grass beside a tombstone
GrownPumpkin: Grown pumpkins
PumpkinBody: A fully grown pumpkin broken during Halloween
StorageCoreBody: Used on a storage unit of this tier, it takes all the unit's items out as this core and leaves the unit empty
EmptyUnitBody: A storage unit emptied that way breaks into an empty one
